# Agit02DoomTrooperAgit (35414), every draw 0, 300 away from the character. A hit takes none of the
# parent's hate: it wants to attack the character by the damage over its maximum HP (440 for the
# scenario's level 1 template) over 0.05, times 100: 22 / 440 / 0.05 * 100 = 100.
character Hunter 20
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastSplash.WarriorCastSplash
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorCastSplash.Agit02DoomTrooperAgit
npc trooper 35414 Monster 300 0 0

hit trooper 22
  desires trooper attack(player)=100
